# Whitelist: only scripts, docs and patches are published. Everything else
# (backup/ with persist, modem/IMEI partitions and GPT, immagini/ with the
# rootfs and its password hash, boot images, Magisk APK) stays local.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!LICENSE
!scripts/
!scripts/**
!patches/
!patches/**
!magisk/
!magisk/*.sh
!magisk/modulo/
!magisk/modulo/**
